}]},{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"case-intro__overview"},"children":[{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"module-subtitle-copy--small module-subtitle-copy gutters"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","attrs":{"class":"section-title p7 ttu fw440"},"children":[{"tag":"span","attrs":{"class":"fw300"},"children":["/ "]},"overview"]},{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"structured-text p2 fw440 module-subtitle-copy__content"},"children":[{"tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":["We worked incredibly hard to make it as period-accurate as possible and, like all our projects, it was hand-drawn by an incredible team of artists. We even used a variety of practical effects in the film, which was a lot of fun to do. We had a brilliant time making this film and learnt a huge amount while studying the masters of the 60s and 70s."]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"module-factory","data-v-b402eb9f":""},"children":[{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"module-sbs gutters module-proxy","data-header-theme":"light","data-header-leave":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"figure","attrs":{"class":"module-sbs__fig bg-loading"},"children":[{"tag":"picture","attrs":{"class":"base-image--fit base-image"},"children":[{"tag":"img","attrs":{"class":"base-image__img","src":"/assets/1771927756-gorilaz_themountain_youtube_4k_1_1_jn_050-74f078c757.webp","width":"1704","height":"1704","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","srcset":"/assets/1771927756-gorilaz_themountain_youtube_4k_1_1_jn_050-86efa0deb7.webp 426w,/assets/1771927756-gorilaz_themountain_youtube_4k_1_1_jn_050-d7099bbb96.webp 852w,/assets/1771927756-gorilaz_themountain_youtube_4k_1_1_jn_050-74f078c757.webp 1704w","sizes":"(max-width: 1704px) 100vw, 1704px"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"figure","attrs":{"class":"module-sbs__fig bg-loading"},"children":[{"tag":"picture","attrs":{"class":"base-image--fit base-image"},"children":[{"tag":"img","attrs":{"class":"base-image__img","src":"/assets/1771928253-gorilaz_themountain_youtube_4k_14_14_92193-7b5e255428.webp","width":"1704","height":"1704","alt":"","loading":"lazy","decoding":"async","srcset":"/assets/1771928253-gorilaz_themountain_youtube_4k_14_14_92193-f2c0b525e3.webp 426w,/assets/1771928253-gorilaz_themountain_youtube_4k_14_14_92193-b23f5f0cc6.webp 852w,/assets/1771928253-gorilaz_themountain_youtube_4k_14_14_92193-7b5e255428.webp 1704w","sizes":"(max-width: 1704px) 100vw, 1704px"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"module-subtitle-copy--small module-subtitle-copy gutters module-proxy"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","attrs":{"class":"section-title p7 ttu fw440"},"children":[{"tag":"span","attrs":{"class":"fw300"},"children":["/ "]},"Backgrounds "]},{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"structured-text p2 fw440 module-subtitle-copy__content"},"children":[{"tag":"p","attrs":{},"children":["We tried to compose shots in the same way they would have in the animated feature films of the 60s, they often painted master backgrounds for scenes and cut into crops of these, often that resulted in beautiful impressionistic close ups of beautiful brush work and simplification reminiscent of depth of field in camera. All the backgrounds are hand painted, but for many of the shots we adopted a hybrid approach, mixing real watercolours with a digital polish and final paint. The natural behaviour of watercolours on paper, the way pigments bleed, settle and absorb into the surface, revealing its texture, is difficult to replicate digitally. With traditional materials, you get those organic qualities for free."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"module-carousel module-proxy"},"children":[{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"module-carousel__grid grid"},"children":[{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"module-carousel__wrapper"},"children":[{"tag":"div","attrs":{"class":"module-carousel__inner","name":"module-carousel"},"children":[{"tag":"figure","attrs":{"class":"module-carousel__fig","style":""},"children":[{"tag":"picture","attrs":{"class":"base-image--fit base-image"},"children":[{"tag":"img","attrs":{